# Code owners — review routing for the areas where a mistake is a
# correctness or licensing incident rather than a style issue. For a
# project this size CODEOWNERS is usually overkill; here it is deliberate:
# license discipline is a distribution-blocking constraint, and the golden
# fixtures are the correctness contract.
#
# NOTE: replace @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER with the actual maintainer GitHub
# handle (or a maintainers team) before enabling "Require review from Code
# Owners" in the branch ruleset.

# Numerical contract: kernels, backends, committed goldens
/Sources/SplatXKernelSrc/   @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER
/Sources/SplatXCore/        @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER
/fixtures/                  @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER

# Licensing / provenance surface
/docs/provenance.md         @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER
/NOTICE                     @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER
/LICENSE                    @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER
/ThirdParty/                @POSTMEDIA-MAINTAINER
